CHECK:UNNECESSARY_PARENTHESES: Unnecessary parentheses around 'fis.command == ATA_CMD_SEC_ERASE_UNIT'
#55: FILE: drivers/block/mtip32xx/mtip32xx.c:2221:
+	if ((fis.command == ATA_CMD_SEC_ERASE_UNIT) && outbuf &&
+					(outbuf[0] & MTIP_SEC_ERASE_MODE)) {

Parentheses are not required in the following cases:

  1. Function pointer uses::

      (foo->bar)();

    could be::

      foo->bar();

  2. Comparisons in if::

      if ((foo->bar) && (foo->baz))
      if ((foo == bar))

    could be::

      if (foo->bar && foo->baz)
      if (foo == bar)

  3. addressof/dereference single Lvalues::

      &(foo->bar)
      *(foo->bar)

    could be::

      &foo->bar
      *foo->bar

